SkyreachIsle_House_Text_FalconerGift::
    .string "I flew birds off these cliffs\n"
    .string "for fifty years.\p"
    .string "You came down from the summit, so\n"
    .string "you've met FALKNER and WINONA.\p"
    .string "Take my old falcon's beak charm.\n"
    .string "It suits a young flier better.$"

SkyreachIsle_House_Text_FalconerReceived::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a SHARP BEAK!$"

SkyreachIsle_House_Text_FalconerAfter::
    .string "A POKéMON holding a SHARP BEAK\n"
    .string "hits harder with FLYING moves.\p"
    .string "Mind the wind in GALE CAVE.\n"
    .string "It howls all the way up to 2F.$"

SkyreachIsle_House_Text_FalconerNoRoom::
    .string "Oh, your BAG is full.\p"
    .string "Make some room and come back.\n"
    .string "It will keep until then.$"

